{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05888","headline":"饭覆釜山僧 · 王维","name":"饭覆釜山僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚知清净理，日与人羣疎。\n将候远山僧，先期埽弊庐。\n果从云峰里，顾我蓬蒿居。\n藉草饭松屑，焚香看道书。\n然灯昼欲尽，鸣磬夜方初。\n一悟寂爲乐，此日闲有余。\n思归何必深，身世犹空虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05888.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05888","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}